coi

That's a good trick with {li'o}. Thank you.

I've attached where I'm up to in my mekso translation (attachments get
forwarded to the list right?). Feedback on my choices of translations of
technical words is welcome. Feel free to ask if anything doesn't make sense
(highly likely). Feedback on whether or not a piece of mex is grammatical is
less welcome (because mex is imo broken). Part of my motivation to do this
translation is to get a feel for which parts of mex need fixing.

Lunchtime!

mu'omi'e ros.

